,"layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]嗯，谢谢你的安慰。想到你能理解我，我心里好受多了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]那个……以后要是有烦心事，我能来找你聊聊吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"}],"des":"埃迪蒂-亲密2"}